"><h3 class="permissions-card-title">You control access. You can review every action.</h3><p class="permissions-card-desc">Agents only get the permissions you approve. You can require approval for sensitive actions, and every step is logged so you always know what happened.</p><a data-testid="cu-button" class="CuLink_link__CFBMW v5 CuButtonV5_button__SDlee button-regular permissions-card-learn-more-btn" rel="" target="" href="#">Learn more</a></div><div class="permissions-card-content"><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionsVisual__Rtqrl"><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionsLeft__UYgZV"><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Isolated workspaces</span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Permission control</span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Secure integrations</span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Credential protection</span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span></div></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionsCenter__drQ5a"><img class="PermissionsVisual_agentAscii__dS0cS" src="images/ascii_agent.webp" alt="Ascii Agent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="PermissionsVisual_agentNormal__f89ob" src="images/normal_agent.webp" alt="Normal Agent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><canvas class="PermissionsVisual_scannerGlow__q3W5K"></canvas></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionsRight__S41U_"><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Approval options</span></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Activity logs</span></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Continuous monitoring</span></div><div class="PermissionsVisual_permissionItem__j278P"><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLine__xIHrD"></span><span class="PermissionsVisual_permissionLabel__ZfrpD">Clear escalation rules</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cu-section-header CUSectionHeader_cuSectionHeader__3dG1Y CUSectionHeader_light__L3pzS faq-section-header"><span class="header-eyebrow CUSectionHeader_headerEyebrow__1HtFf">[ FAQ ]</span><div class="header-divider CUSectionHeader_headerDivider__ilUZT"></div><div class="header-content CUSectionHeader_headerContent__mIeax"><div class="header-left CUSectionHeader_headerLeft__eK3xg"><h2 class="header-title CUSectionHeader_headerTitle__Jls4_">AI Agent FAQs. No buzzwords.</h2></div><div class="header-right CUSectionHeader_headerRight__nlSRy"><p class="header-description CUSectionHeader_headerDescription___GBZv">Most “AI” pages are vague. Ours isn’t. These are role-based agents that run follow-ups across leads, delivery, and payments so you scale without hiring and stay in control.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq-accordion">
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>What is an AI agent?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>An AI agent is a role-based digital worker that executes repeatable tasks inside your existing tools. Think inbox and calendar, lead response, project follow-ups, support triage, and invoice nudges.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>Do you offer a guarantee?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. You get a 14-day money-back guarantee. If it’s not a fit, we refund you.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>Can my team use it too?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. You can add your team so agents can coordinate handoffs, route tasks, and escalate exceptions to the right person.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>What can I use AI agents for?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>The work that usually breaks as you grow: fast replies, consistent follow-ups, scheduling, project coordination, client updates, support triage, and payment reminders.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>How do we get started?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Pick the roles you want, connect your tools, set simple rules, and launch. You can do it in the dashboard, and we’ll guide you end-to-end.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>Will this replace my employees?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>It replaces repetitive execution, not ownership or decision-making. Your team stays in control while agents handle the busywork and keep everything moving.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
      <span>What tools does it work with?</span>
      <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="faq-answer"><p>Google and Microsoft tools, plus mainstream platforms like ClickUp and Trello. If it’s a common workflow, we can usually connect it.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="line line-right" style="--line-color:#2A2A2A;--dash-size:3px;--dash-gap:4px"></div></div><div class="flash-end-wrapper"></div></section></div><section class="post-dark-section" style="display:none"><img src="images/flash_end.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="flash-end"><div class="Container_container__tbJnt"><div class="OneTwoCU_oneTwoCu__8el0W OneTwoCU_imageRight__VUp65 OneTwoCU_noBorders__WM4UP"><div class="OneTwoCU_imageWrapper__qX3mt"><div class="hover-3d fair-billing-image"><div class="hover-3d-card"><img src="/images/card.webp" alt="super agents card illustration" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="super-agent-card-image"><div class="glow"></div></div></div></div><div class="OneTwoCU_sectionContent___m0gx"><div class="OneTwoCU_sectionHeader__jNoW1"><span class="OneTwoCU_sectionEyebrow__9Em9P">SUPER FAIR BILLING POLICY</span><h3 class="section-title OneTwoCU_sectionTitle__Wd9I1">When we optimize, you save $</h3><p class="section-description OneTwoCU_sectionDescription__AYRML">When our teams save on AI costs, we pass them onto you. When sudden increases in AI costs occur as a result of new models or other changes, we subsidize the cost so you don't see any sudden increases on credit usage.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="roi-section" style="display:none">
  <div class="roi-container">
    <div class="roi-header">
      <div class="roi-header-left">
        <span class="roi-eyebrow">THE IMPACT</span>
        <h2 class="roi-title">It&rsquo;s like adding <span class="roi-highlight">15 full-time</span> employees</h2>
      </div>
